Return ONLY a JSON object (no markdown fences, no commentary) with keys: summary (2-4 sentences), lineByLine (array of {lines, note}, important sections only), complexityAnalysis (1-2 sentences), potentialIssues (array of strings), suggestions (array of strings), securityConcern (boolean), securityDetails (string, empty if securityConcern is false).
